                    "name": "Claude"
                },
                "message": "Merge sp-paths into sp-globals and move my main settings there\n\nsp-globals now holds the locations of sp-paths (which is no longer a\nmodule, but is still provided as a feature) and the settings that were\nspread over the modules: bibliography options, dashboard privacy, spelling\nprogram and dictionaries, prompts, bells and dialogs, backup folder and\nlock files, the week start, the scratch buffer, the user identity and the\nfolders of sp-bibprocess, sp-scratch, sp-treemacs, sp-tab-inbox,\nsp-emoji-font and sp-trails.\n\nEvery place a setting used to live now has a comment that points to\nsp-globals, in the .el files and in the docs. The default font and the\ntheme stay where they are.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PF79fi4scSSid1V5FvNkEF",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "5673df7cb0d9fcdf15713ee0d79bd0be83bbdb47",
